  <GuiltyPrisonerDied_Know_Respected.stages.responsible_for_the_death_of_a_prisoner.label>对囚犯之死负有责任</GuiltyPrisonerDied_Know_Respected.stages.responsible_for_the_death_of_a_prisoner.label>
